            </note>
            <note corresp="#d270-f5" n="5" xml:id="d270-f5-content">
                <p>No memorandum of this conversation has been found in Department of State files,
                    but see <ref target="#d271"><hi rendition="#italic">infra</hi></ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d270-f6" n="6" xml:id="d270-f6-content">
